  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghthening th Civil Society Contribution to Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposal sought funding for two areas. One is for CPA&#x2019;s work and core support for the organization and three separate activities and the second, specifically relating to the services and visits of the internationally renowned electoral expert Mr. Kare Vollan who has visited Sri Lanka as a resource person on a new electoral system at the invitation of the Prime Minister of Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
